<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro allows you to dig axes in this LumberTycoon2 irge. Good axes in LumberTycoon2 are practically impossible to get yourself (only to purchase from players) with a similar problem, players found various methods to illegally get them as a result, a dup was found after a while fixed, a new easier one was noticed with it, it is possible to dig axes quickly and simply, but not every time it is possible to get into timing and dig an axe as a consequence after that, I decided to record this macro.There are all chances to be no big mistakes, I did not check the macro the way my license ended, I am trying to fix the bugs that I will find.
For the dup, an earthen plot is still needed for construction on it, there will not be a dup on an empty plot, because this irga will have nothing to load. You should have a save with items on the first slot. Put the axe on the 1st connector of the inventory that you will be using, do not take it in your hand, it must lie in the inventory. If it reports false in a light square , then you entered and immediately began to dupat , you need to wait for the same time to roll back saving 1-2 minutes .</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
